            "review_title": "Review at Tannin Wine Bar & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "andrew l\nSeoul, South Korea2 contributions\n0\nBest Spot for a glass of wine in Hanoi, CBD Hoan Kiem\nAug 2022 • Couples\nLong walked on the steets of alley of historic Hoan Kiem. You wouldn't be mistake to find its one of the best stop over for a glass of wine when you are exhausted of all the foot steps. \n\n더워서 굉장히 힘들었는데 정말 편하게 마실수 있는 와인바 (Wine Bar) 였어요 Italian Spritz, 최고, 호안끼엠 에서 제일 맛있게 마신거 같아요. 덮기도 더웠고\n\n다시 하노이에 오면 나는 꼭 가볼곳!!!\n\nCheers\nRead more\nWritten August 19, 2022",
