            "review_title": "Review at Tannin Wine Bar & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Maxou\nHanoi, Vietnam32 contributions\n0\nAmazing wine selection, fantastic food!\nJul 2022\nIf you are looking for a wine bar to chill out and browse through an extensive selection at a good price, this is for you! There's great attention to detail, whether it is on the wine list itself (with both famous and more obscure appellations and producers covered) or on the food menu (the soft shell crab was incredible!). \n\nVery cozy atmosphere, good playlists too. Recommended for afterwork drinks or a date. Although this is pure wine lover's paradise, if you happen to have a non-wino friend (really?), they also serve some beer or Pimm's.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 15, 2022\nMatt P\nThanks for your detailed review 🙏\nWritten August 16, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
