            "review_text": "Thomas R\n6 contributions\n0\nExcellent! Favourite spot in mid-town Hanoi!\nAug 2022\nBest wine selection, a list that feels unlimited and always in stock with my favourites!\n\nI tend to go for business lunches and evening drinks late in the week, either way the ambience is always warm and relaxing.\n\nThe food is 5 star and make sure you try 'Spritz' on a hot day, best in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 14, 2022\nMatt P\nThanks for your kind review 🙏 🥂\nWritten August 14, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
